#. module: dally_api
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dally_api.dally_api_key_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Available scopes:</strong>\n"
"                        <code>leads:write</code>, <code>quotes:write</code>,\n"
"                        <code>sourcing:write</code>, <code>trading:write</code>,\n"
"                        <code>shipments:read</code>, <code>tracking:read</code>,\n"
"                        <code>customers:read</code>.\n"
"                        Grant only what the consumer actually calls: a key restricted to\n"
"                        <code>leads:write</code> is useless to an attacker who wants to\n"
"                        read customer data."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Portées disponibles :</strong>\n"
"                        <code>leads:write</code>, <code>quotes:write</code>,\n"
"                        <code>sourcing:write</code>, <code>trading:write</code>,\n"
"                        <code>shipments:read</code>, <code>tracking:read</code>,\n"
"                        <code>customers:read</code>.\n"
"                        N’accordez que les portées réellement utilisées par le client : une clé limitée à\n"
"                        <code>leads:write</code> est inutile à un attaquant qui cherche à\n"
"                        lire les données client."

